diagnostics/random-fraction.em:3:6: warning: `random_fraction` hides Emerald's built-in `random_fraction`
  func random_fraction(): Float {
       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
A name the program declares always wins, so `random_fraction` here means this one. Write `Emerald.random_fraction` to reach the built-in, or choose a different name.
